’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Reset input and returns the card to its origin."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/writingToolsBehavior(_:)":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"writingToolsBehavior","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI20WritingToolsBehaviorV","text":"WritingToolsBehavior","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/writingToolsBehavior(_:)","title":"writingToolsBehavior(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/writingtoolsbehavior(_:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/swami","abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","title":"Swami","kind":"symbol"}}}